00:28:20,031 --> 00:28:22,351
君に Baby Sweet Berry Love
Baby Sweet Berry Love for you,

282
00:28:22,491 --> 00:28:25,211
自分 を 守る より 大切な コト が ある の
I want to protect myself, all the important things

283
00:28:25,471 --> 00:28:27,791
こんなにも 近くに
Are in a place this close to me.

284
00:28:32,531 --> 00:28:35,191
君と Baby Sweet Berry Love
Baby Sweet Berry Love with you,

285
00:28:35,351 --> 00:28:38,071
きっと ぎこちなくて でもね 真っ直ぐに見つめて
I know I'm very clumsy, but I still want to keep looking at you,

